      "why": "k chained micro-rotations/cycle gives 1 result per ceil(N/k)+3 cycles, so meeting the burst bound needs Fmax ≈ 73·(ceil(N/k)+3) ≈ 290–365 MHz even at k=8 — probably infeasible on Artix-7. A small share is spent only to confirm this and to catch any low-area point if high k does reach the required issue rate.",
